  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi guys.\nI've had a question. I wanted to ask if it was psossible to ad Leap Motion Support in VRChat.\nI have an Index as an example but I do rather be on Desktop.\nBack in the days of Melonloader I was able to use a mod, to have Handtracking in Desktop, Wich I figured was an awesome feature I'd like to have in the game. After all it's alsow lucrative for people who doesen't want to buy a VR but still want to moove their hands in Desktop.\nI'd apriciate VRChat implementing LeapMotion support so I can use this awesome device again and have again the awesome VRChat experience like back in the days bevore EAC came out.",
